{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46646","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见图画 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见图画","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见图画，云门兴似饶。\n衲衣椶笠重，嵩岳华山遥。\n命在斋犹赴，刀闲发尽凋。\n秋光渐轻健，欲去倚江桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}